 "descricao": "Heaven by Maison Viegas is a Citrus Aromatic fragrance for women and men. Heaven was launched in 2021. Top notes are Citron, Calabrian bergamot and Sicilian Orange; middle notes are Tunisian Neroli, Nigerian Ginger and Ceylon Cinnamon; base notes are Chinese Black Tea, Ambroxan, Frankincense and Guaiac Wood.\nHeaven is more than a fragrance; it is the sublime expression of boldness and creative spirit that transform dreams into unforgettable realities. Inspired by experiences and journeys that broaden one’s worldview, this essence captures the power of freedom and exploration.\nAn olfactory signature that combines sensuality and masculine sophistication. In perfect harmony, notes of noble citrus and Chinese black tea complete this composition, evoking the essence of distant adventures and moments of pure transcendence.\nWith Heaven, each spray is an invitation to free the mind, elevate the senses and explore new paths of pleasure and freedom. A perfume that transcends the ordinary, guiding the imagination to a state of absolute elevation.",
